  id: radixTalk
  title: Radix Talk
  author: Infusion
  description: "74 in base 11 is 52. Oh wait, I wasn\u2019t being specific enough.\n\nConvert
    a number to a certain base, while the number and base are also shown in other
    bases (radixes).\n\nThis is probably my easiest module yet. It can even be a solo.\n\nManual
    can be found at ktane.timwi.de or in the bundled manuals folder.\nSource code
    is at https://github.com/Infusion478/KTANE-Radix-Talk\n\nComes with Twitch Plays
    support."
